(a) The permit of body art studio may be denied, suspended, or revoked upon one or more of the following grounds:
(1) Failure of the permit holder to maintain initial requirements for obtaining the permit;
(2) The owner allows or permits any person who does not have a valid body artist permit to perform a body art procedure in the body art studio;
